(>> 4.3 Digital Electronics and Boolean Logic Gates) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
() Tj
T*
(* Logic Gates: AND \(Y = A . B\), OR \(Y = A + B\), NOT \(Y = A'\), NAND \(Y = \(A . B\)'\),) Tj
T*
(NOR \(Y = \(A + B\)'\), XOR \(Y = A \(+\) B = A'B + AB'\), XNOR \(Y = AB + A'B'\).) Tj
T*
(* Universal Gates: NAND and NOR are universal gates because any combinational Boolean) Tj
T*
(circuit \(AND, OR, NOT, XOR\) can be constructed exclusively using only NAND or only) Tj
T*
