([SOLVED PROBLEM 3: Boolean Function Minimization and NAND Implementation]) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
/F2 9.5 Tf
(-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
(Problem: Simplify the Boolean expression F\(A, B, C\) = sum m\(1, 3, 5, 7\) + d\(2\) using) Tj
T*
(Karnaugh Map \(K-Map\) and implement the minimal expression using only 2-input NAND gates.) Tj
T*
(Solution Step 1: Plot 3-variable K-Map \(Variables A on rows, BC on columns\):) Tj
T*
(BC=00 BC=01 BC=11 BC=10) Tj
T*
(A = 0 0 1\(m1\) 1\(m3\) X\(d2\)) Tj
T*
(A = 1 0 1\(m5\) 1\(m7\) 0) Tj
T*
(Solution Step 2: Group adjacent 1s and don't-cares:) Tj
T*
(Minterms m1, m3, m5, m7 form a single 4-cell quad covering column BC = 01 and BC = 11.) Tj
T*
(In this quad: A changes \(0 to 1, eliminated\); B changes \(0 to 1, eliminated\); C remains) Tj
T*
(constant at 1.) Tj
T*
(Minimal Expression: F\(A, B, C\) = C.) Tj
T*
(Alternative Expression with m1, m2, m3, m5: F = A'B + C.) Tj
T*
(For F = A'B + C: Apply double negation for NAND implementation:) Tj
T*
(F = \( \(A'B + C\)' \)' = \( \(A'B\)' . C' \)'.) Tj
T*
(Implementation requires 3 NAND gates: \(1\) Invert A to A', \(2\) NAND\(A', B\), \(3\) Invert C) Tj
T*
(to C', and \(4\) NAND the results.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
/F2 9.5 Tf
(-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
/F2 9.5 Tf
([SOLVED PROBLEM 4: Half Adder Implementation via Universal NOR Gates]) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
/F2 9.5 Tf
(-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
(Problem: Design a Half Adder \(Sum S = A \(+\) B, Carry C = A . B\) exclusively using only) Tj
T*
(2-input NOR gates. Determine the minimum gate count required.) Tj
T*
(Solution Step 1: Express Carry C = A . B in NOR form:) Tj
T*
(Apply De Morgan's theorem: A . B = \( \(A . B\)' \)' = \( A' + B' \)'.) Tj
T*
(NOR Formulation of Carry: Invert A and B using NOR gates \(A' = A NOR A, B' = B NOR B\),) Tj
T*
(then NOR the inverted inputs: C = \(A' NOR B'\) = \(A' + B'\)' = A . B.) Tj
T*
(Solution Step 2: Express Sum S = A'B + AB' in NOR form:) Tj
T*
(S = \(A + B\) . \(A . B\)' = \(A + B\) . \(A' + B'\).) Tj
T*
(Using standard 5-NOR gate universal XOR topology:) Tj
T*
(Gate 1: N1 = \(A NOR B\) = \(A + B\)'.) Tj
T*
(Gate 2: N2 = \(A NOR N1\) = \(A + \(A + B\)'\)' = A' . \(A + B\) = A'B.) Tj
T*
ET

